1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:02,441
“Handball is handball” isn't a thing.

2
00:00:03,036 --> 00:00:04,960
The law asks three questions.

3
00:00:05,834 --> 00:00:06,694
First of all:

4
00:00:06,667 --> 00:00:07,573
where did it hit?

5
00:00:08,168 --> 00:00:09,965
The arm starts below the armpit.

6
00:00:10,564 --> 00:00:12,269
The shoulder is not handball.

7
00:00:13,146 --> 00:00:14,040
Question one:

8
00:00:14,014 --> 00:00:15,001
was it deliberate?

9
00:00:15,596 --> 00:00:17,220
If you move your hand towards the

10
00:00:17,031 --> 00:00:18,678
ball, it's always a foul.

11
00:00:19,546 --> 00:00:20,059
Two:

12
00:00:20,055 --> 00:00:21,795
did the arm make the body unnaturally

13
00:00:21,606 --> 00:00:22,188
bigger?

14
00:00:22,783 --> 00:00:24,314
Then it's a foul, even if you

15
00:00:24,126 --> 00:00:25,043
didn't mean it.

16
00:00:25,922 --> 00:00:26,504
Three:

17
00:00:26,443 --> 00:00:28,055
do you score right after it touches

18
00:00:27,866 --> 00:00:28,668
your hand?

19
00:00:29,263 --> 00:00:31,755
Goal disallowed, even if it was accidental.

20
00:00:32,633 --> 00:00:33,678
Three noes?

21
00:00:34,274 --> 00:00:35,099
Play on.

22
00:00:35,697 --> 00:00:37,367
And inside the box the law is

23
00:00:37,179 --> 00:00:37,796
the same:

24
00:00:37,792 --> 00:00:39,347
only the punishment changes.

25
00:00:40,210 --> 00:00:41,255
And the goalkeeper?

26
00:00:41,850 --> 00:00:44,434
Outside the penalty area, he's just another

27
00:00:44,246 --> 00:00:44,874
player.

28
00:00:45,746 --> 00:00:47,636
Save it, and share it with whoever

29
00:00:47,447 --> 00:00:49,245
shouts handball at every touch.

